{"displayStem":"54세 남자의 신장생검 판독에서 괴사성 초승달 사구체신염이 보고되었다. IF 대조와 표본의 질은 적합했고 IgG·IgA·IgM 침착은 미미했다. 그림은 실제 병리사진이 아닌 세 가지 침착 분포의 독립 교육 모식도이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"교육용 가상 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C05 c05-batch\"><div class=\"evidence c05-figure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 620 360\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"독립 제작 구조 모식도\"><rect width=\"620\" height=\"360\" fill=\"white\"></rect><g font-family=\"Noto Sans CJK KR, sans-serif\" fill=\"black\"><text x=\"100\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"22\">가</text><ellipse cx=\"110\" cy=\"160\" rx=\"72\" ry=\"95\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><ellipse cx=\"110\" cy=\"160\" rx=\"66\" ry=\"89\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><text x=\"300\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"22\">나</text><ellipse cx=\"310\" cy=\"160\" rx=\"72\" ry=\"95\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><circle cx=\"375.0\" cy=\"160.0\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"367.6\" cy=\"200.4\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"346.9\" cy=\"231.6\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"317.8\" cy=\"246.4\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"287.0\" cy=\"241.3\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"261.3\" cy=\"217.7\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"246.9\" cy=\"180.8\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"246.9\" cy=\"139.2\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"261.3\" cy=\"102.3\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"287.0\" cy=\"78.7\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"317.8\" cy=\"73.6\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"346.9\" cy=\"88.4\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"367.6\" cy=\"119.6\" r=\"5\" fill=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"500\" y=\"35\" font-size=\"22\">다</text><ellipse cx=\"510\" cy=\"160\" rx=\"72\" ry=\"95\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></ellipse><circle cx=\"570\" cy=\"132\" r=\"3\" fill=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"35\" y=\"300\" font-size=\"19\">한 사구체 모세혈관 고리의 침착 분포 모식도</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"335\" font-size=\"19\">실제 면역형광 영상 아님</text></g></svg></div></div>"]}